  (tedit 63DAF38E)
  (descr "Cutout + edge-castellation mount for LuckFox Pico Mini: the module nests underneath the shield through this slot (component side up, facing the shield), and its 22 castellated edge pads are lap-soldered directly to the pads here -- no header/socket. Cutout sized to LuckFox's 21.00x28.14mm outline plus 0.15mm clearance per side; pads centered on LuckFox's nominal edge line (2.54mm pitch, 17.78mm row spacing, per LuckFox's official mechanical drawing) so they straddle the routed slot edge. Confirm the 0.15mm clearance and pad size against your fab house's minimum slot/annular tolerances before ordering.")
